A||||4||rogergarrison||Radiator fan didnt shut off||||1||
Z||000000||rogergarrison||10-27-2001||02:54 PM||||First problem Ive had like this. I turned car off to go into a restaurant. I didnt pay attention, but figured out afterward the cooling fan stayed on after I shut off the car. Drained the battery completely dead in a couple hours so it wouldnt jump or push start. Had to change battery. Any one know which relay operates it. I cant trace it since it seems to be working fine now. Id like to replace it anyway as a precaution.<BR>I also just put a new battery in for the heck of it, other was 4 years old anyway. <p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 10-27-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Sage||10-27-2001||05:03 PM||||Should be the one in front of the driver's side headlight.  You can tell cause the harness goes directly from there to the fan motor.  If you don't see it right off the bat, just start at the fan motor and trace the harness backwards, should be the first thing you encounter before the fan.<P> You may just have dirty contacts in the connector.  Never bought that relay, so can't say how much they cost.<P>Hope you get it straightened out post haste!<P>------------------<BR>Have a good one!||||reg||1
Z||000002||FieroBUZZ||10-27-2001||05:06 PM||||I just bought a relay at UAP (C$15).  Cured a fan no run prob I had.<BR>Gary||||reg||1
Z||000003||maryjane||10-28-2001||01:32 AM||||If it is a two speed fan, the relay is around $60 at the Fiero Store. Single speed relays are about $18, I think. Maybe a little less, I can't remember exactly, just that it seemed awfully high at the time.(2 spd)<BR>Had the same problem. The relay stuck, pitted contacts, and the fan just ran till the battery was dead. You can clean the contacts and get a little more use out of them, but it's not worth being stranded somewhere with a dead battery.||||reg||1
Z||000004||K2m4||10-29-2001||01:51 PM||||Man i only paid 8 bucks at NAPA for a fan relay for a single speed fan. Sounds like you guys may be getting ripped off...idk<P>kerm<P>------------------<BR>||||reg||1
